('MutationC1Pending','mutation-tester','Mutation test C1 pending-fill detector against A3: plant pending only in non-result body line; pending_review substring; case changes; removed vs retained; see if whole-text word-boundary rule behaves. Scratch fixtures only. Report MUTANTS, KILLED, SURVIVORS, VERDICT.'),
('MutationC1Json','mutation-tester','Mutation test C1 result span JSON colon forms and duplicate/order semantics. Plant "met":true→false, findings/count fields, duplicate result lines reorder/remove; determine which cases C1 counter catches and which residuals remain. Report MUTANTS, KILLED, SURVIVORS, VERDICT.'),
