('CriticC1Deletion','critic','Attack C1 deletion/re-add handling under A3. Construct receipt delete, delete+re-add same blob, rename-with-edit, absent-at-revision; determine tool finding kinds and counter coverage. Report CASES, GAPS, VERDICT.'),
('ReviewerC1Population','reviewer','Re-derive frozen population-144 at base and A2 scope for extra_member. Confirm measurement-round controls excluded while earlier-round added path is still caught. Check any hidden path or extension class omitted. Report POPULATION, CASES, VERDICT.'),
('CriticC1Claim','critic',"Axis-level falsification: does C1 actually improve calibration given c58's existing receipt ledger and the 12 events already disclosed? Apply do-nothing control and claim admission rule; distinguish capability from axis move. Report AXIS, CONTROL, VERDICT."),
