('ReviewerC2Counter','reviewer','Run/review c61_header_cases.py at its base and implementation revisions in scratch; verify exactly H1-H18 scored, R3 separate shape gate, R4 control, outputs/exits and expected finding sets. Report CASES, DENOMINATOR, VERDICT.'),
('CriticC2Semantics','critic','Falsify all six C2 classes against retained S430-S433 bodies and the 12 capture receipts: content-type, HSTS, XCTO, CSP, singleton, field_name_syntax. Empty values, missing vs false flags, duplicate field case, OWS, 2xx boundary. Report per-class false green/red, evidence, verdict.'),
