('CriticC2ManifestPolicy','critic','Falsify manifest policy: whether expectations are uniform and predeclared, whether all-false checks can force green (H16), URL scheme controls HSTS, source path traversal/receipt tampering and status handling. Report concrete counterexamples and verdict.'),
